meta {
  name: Update Settings
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "store_name": "Example",
    "brand_tagline": "string",
    "email_from_name": "buyer@example.com"
  }
}

docs {
**Access:** Admin (bearer)

**Request body** `StoreConfigUpdate`:
  - `store_name`: string|null
  - `brand_tagline`: string|null
  - `email_from_name`: string|null
  - `primary_color`: string|null
  - `logo_url`: string|null
  - `legal_name`: string|null
  - `address_line`: string|null
  - `address_line2`: string|null
  - `postal_city`: string|null
  - `country`: string|null
  - `tax_id`: string|null
  - `nip`: string|null
  - `regon`: string|null
  - `krs`: string|null
  - `email`: string|null
  - `phone`: string|null
  - `social_instagram`: string|null
  - `social_facebook`: string|null
  - `social_tiktok`: string|null
  - `social_youtube`: string|null
  - `invoice_vat_rate`: integer|null
  - `returns_window_days`: integer|null
  - `low_stock_default_threshold`: integer|null
  - `abandoned_cart_enabled`: boolean|null
  - `abandoned_cart_threshold_hours`: integer|null

**Responses:** 200, 422
}
